teacher_info.about_teacher:
I started teaching English in 2009, firstly in a specialist language school and then to private students. I have also: 
* done voiceovers for radio and film;
* edited a book (about Business English);
* devised and taught an English course to victims of human trafficking.

I take the time to research your mother tongue which helps me understand why you make the mistakes that you make or pronounce words the way that you do. This means that you get results faster and we both end up happy!

***PLEASE NOTE: Italki's policy is 24 HOURS FOR CHANGES AND CANCELLATIONS and in line with this, unfortunately I am unable to make exceptions. Thank you for understanding***
